      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, I greatly preferred the old design where the friends winglet was always visible on the right side and persisted to be visible with page reloads. Now it's always hidden by default. It's not uncommon for me to have > 3 VRChat Home browser tabs open, and I want the friends winglet visible on each of them.\n\nMy comment should probably be its own general feedback ticket, but it's tangential to this change.",
